	ZH 1:
	R
	'   Before the Castle Wall'
	\L_0341b:
	\L_0340e:
	\L_0332e:
	ZH 1:
	'Next to the giant castle wall,'
	R
	'a shadow was settling.'
	\L_0341b:
	ZH 1:
	'It wavered a bit. In the next'
	R
	'instant, it was gone.'
	\L_0341b:
	ZH 1:
	'The towering wall was useless'
	R
	'against this being.'
	\L_0341b:
	ZH 1:
	'The shadow slipped into the'
	R
	'castle.'
	R
	'It was JAPAN’s ninja, Gekkou.'
